        {
          "text": "Uhoraho aramubarira, ati N’ukuri abantu banje bari muri Egiputa nabonye amarushwa barimwo, numvise gutaka kwabo batakishwa n’ababakoresha babahindagiza; kuko nzi imibabaro yabo, ",
